  /* HOME */
  'home.hero.eyebrow':'Midigama · South Coast, Sri Lanka',
  'home.hero.title':'Where the ocean is <em>fifty metres</em> away.',
  'home.hero.sub':'A small surf & yoga house on Sri Lanka\'s south coast, built for people who came to ride, breathe, and let the days run on ocean time.',
  'home.scroll':'Scroll',
  'home.intro.eyebrow':'The spirit of the place',
  'home.intro.title':'A place where time slows down.',
  'home.intro.body':'Naia is the kind of house a designer who loves the ocean might build, then open to others. No marble lobbies, no piped-in music, just sea-worn wood, soft light, good coffee, and a peeling left-hander breaking across the road. Come to surf hard or to do nothing at all. Both are welcome here.',
  'home.pillars.eyebrow':'Three reasons to come',
  'home.pillars.title':'Surf, yoga, and the long slow stay.',
  'home.pillar.surf.title':'Surf','home.pillar.surf.desc':'World-class reef and point breaks on the doorstep, for intermediate and advanced surfers. Coaching, video, and a board for every swell.',
  'home.pillar.yoga.title':'Yoga','home.pillar.yoga.desc':'Daily classes on the rooftop shala at sunrise and sunset, vinyasa to restore, yin to unwind, breath to come home to yourself.',
