  'rooms.cap.one':'1 guest','rooms.cap.two':'2 guests','rooms.cap.three':'Up to 3 guests',
  'rooms.note.title':'Every stay includes','rooms.note.body':'Fresh tropical breakfast, filtered drinking water, beach towels, board storage, daily housekeeping, and a sunrise wake-up if the swell is good.',

  'room.ocean.name':'Deluxe Sea View','room.ocean.tag':'Sea view','room.ocean.desc':'The biggest room in the house. Vaulted ceiling, oversized bed, and a terrace where the sea fills your horizon before your coffee goes cold.',
  'room.garden.name':'Garden Double','room.garden.tag':'Garden view','room.garden.desc':'Tucked behind the garden, cooler and quieter than the rest. A double bed, a private terrace onto the greenery, and a rhythm entirely your own.',
