  'book.submit':'Request to book','book.or':'or','book.policy.title':'Cancellation policy','book.policy.body':'Free cancellation up to 14 days before arrival. Within 14 days, the first night is charged. No-shows are charged in full. We\'re human, though, talk to us if plans change.',
