  'about.hero.title':'Our story','about.hero.sub':'How a surf trip that never really ended turned into a house by the sea.',
  'about.story.eyebrow':'How it began','about.story.title':'We came for a swell and never left.',
  'about.story.body':'Naia started the way these things often do, a long trip, a wave that kept us, a small house we couldn\'t stop thinking about. We rebuilt it slowly with local hands and salvaged wood, and opened the doors to the kind of travellers we\'d want as friends. It\'s still a family home. You\'re just staying in it for a while.',
  'about.values.eyebrow':'What we care about','about.values.title':'The things we won\'t compromise on.',
